    st.markdown('<div class="j07-section j08-section-head"><span class="j-rail">08</span><span class="j-section-title">What the Model Says</span><span class="j-section-desc">Cross-layer synthesis of all evidence</span><div class="j08-inline-note j08-note"><b>◉ Model view combines 5 Bagger dimensions:</b> Growth, Quality, Valuation, Risk and Momentum. Dividend remains a separate Journal evidence layer and does not feed the Bagger Score.</div></div>',unsafe_allow_html=True)
